#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:1 1450c0f19c99426cbf017d741f9f195a
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "トラブルシューティング"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:3 d530f0f131244be9a8cb521ddb9b83a1
msgid "Common issues encountered when using GWexpy and their solutions."
msgstr "GWexpy の利用時に遭遇しやすい問題とその解決策をまとめます。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:5 37f9b61ef89846799bcbd09bd40b7bbd
msgid "Start Here"
msgstr "まずここを見る"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:7 671a5909f4cd4e308d9358568bddbd00
msgid "Use this page as a reverse lookup by symptom:"
msgstr "症状から逆引きする場合は、次を起点にしてください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:9 f3cd300875e34fb4939fb765a3c28ff5
msgid ""
"Install worked for the minimal example, but you now need NDS2 / FrameLIB / "
"other binary dependencies: go back to the [Installation "
"Guide](../tutorials/installation.md#conda-environment-recommended--gw-"
"analysis)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:10 625c5772ed2149338a87d492b3a1442c
msgid ""
"The first example from [Quickstart](../tutorials/quickstart.md) does not "
"import or plot cleanly: check the matching issue below, then retry the quick"
" example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:11 84cbc6a2941e4b1082bc800430bef03f
msgid ""
"The environment feels mixed or broken after repeated `pip` and Conda "
"changes: rebuild the dedicated Conda environment from the [Installation "
"Guide](../tutorials/installation.md#conda-environment-recommended--gw-"
"analysis)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:13 8bd50c0e386d4984a103eba9795fab99
msgid "Installation Issues"
msgstr "インストール関連"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:15 d097d3aa1bf34c66808d7b64045715ea
msgid "1. Cannot install `nds2` / `framel`"
msgstr "1. `nds2` / `framel` がインストールできない"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:16 5e989c38b030471794309772834a3234
msgid ""
"Binary libraries used in the `[gw]` extra cannot be installed via `pip`."
msgstr "`[gw]` エクストラで使用されるバイナリライブラリは `pip` ではインストールできません。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:18 891cc956ebea4231be820a230a360fca
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Use Conda (Miniforge, etc.) in a dedicated environment, then "
"install GWexpy from source there."
msgstr "**解決策:** Conda (Miniforge 等) で専用環境を作成し、その中で依存関係と GWexpy 本体を順に入れてください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:27 169fb8ea46974d289023e08eb371cdc9
msgid ""
"See also: [Installation Guide](../tutorials/installation.md#conda-"
"environment-recommended--gw-analysis)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:29 78e111a0a5204b518cd461b7b72b6680
msgid "2. Errors on Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) Mac"
msgstr "2. Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3) Mac でのエラー"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:30 8296a27f5d69450e819020d475bfe942
msgid ""
"Some GW analysis packages may be built for Intel (x86_64) and might not work"
" out of the box."
msgstr "一部の GW 解析用パッケージが Intel (x86_64) 版としてビルドされており、そのままでは動作しない場合があります。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:32 fd3f139fdf524de9a3e2266eeb8c9707
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Native (arm64) support for packages from the `conda-forge` "
"channel is improving. Always ensure you are using the latest versions."
msgstr ""
"**解決策:** `conda-forge` チャンネルからインストールしたものに関しては、ネイティブ (arm64) "
"対応が進んでいます。常に最新版に更新してください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:38 c0a2553a23714ac490b807c330264281
msgid "3. Compilation error for `minepy` (MIC calculation)"
msgstr "3. `minepy` (MIC計算) のコンパイルエラー"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:39 2229f4468a9744c58be655a8d8c1f40f
msgid "`pip install minepy` may fail due to C extension compilation issues."
msgstr "`pip install minepy` が C 拡張のコンパイルで失敗することがあります。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:41 c264a592ce9341c7aa8972356c780342
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Run the automated build script included in the repository."
msgstr "**解決策:** リポジトリに含まれる自動ビルドスクリプトを実行してください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:47 07175d7e637a4eaeb3625ef30053fd8c
msgid ""
"If this happened while expanding a minimal install, review the extras "
"guidance in the [Installation "
"Guide](../tutorials/installation.md#3-optional-dependencies-extras-details)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:49 eea38e745ec44ff78691e9e96ad6e4b4
msgid "Plotting & Visualization Issues"
msgstr "描画・可視化関連"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:51 4eb5fda63cdb4b3ea79e400a724ed39b
msgid "4. Plots not displaying / `Tcl_AsyncDelete` error"
msgstr "4. プロットが表示されない / `Tcl_AsyncDelete` エラー"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:52 4606a9279b3e406db2b67cd7088e84d6
msgid ""
"There may be an inconsistency with the Matplotlib backend in Jupyter "
"Notebook or GUI applications."
msgstr "Jupyter Notebook や GUI アプリで Matplotlib のバックエンドに関する不整合が起こっている可能性があります。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:54 0be8d2d6e6214eeb8316d6d126e198c1
msgid "**Solution:** Try explicitly specifying the backend:"
msgstr "**解決策:** バックエンドを明示的に指定して試してください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:61 4f00f37a4e9d4529b172c675983dc155
msgid "5. Map (`GeoMap`) not displaying"
msgstr "5. 地図 (`GeoMap`) が表示されない"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:62 2a6248f9ff3b4b2cb30e22b27db1181f
msgid ""
"Verify the installation status of `pygmt` and ensure the GMT (Generic "
"Mapping Tools) binary is in your path."
msgstr "`pygmt` のインストール状況と、GMT (Generic Mapping Tools) 本体がパスに含まれているか確認してください。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:64 8aca1a773bcc40eb933809a28f0518d2
msgid "**Solution:** We recommend reinstalling `pygmt` via Conda."
msgstr "**解決策:** Conda で `pygmt` を再インストールすることを推奨します。"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:70 5d99d9d4ff074094956fe7e4894fca59
msgid ""
"If you started from the smallest example in "
"[Quickstart](../tutorials/quickstart.md), note that `pygmt` is optional and "
"is not part of the minimal source install."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:74 7e433e04e61b46b9bbbaab2f66533043
msgid "Still Not Working?"
msgstr "解決しない場合"

#: ../../how-to/troubleshooting.md:76 9cd881253e144eaa80290bf5b617c2f0
msgid ""
"For lightweight bug reports and feature requests, use the [feedback "
"form](https://forms.gle/c8jJaf9UCs5tb5cC8). For reproducible technical "
"issues that need public tracking, please report the issue with the error "
"logs on the GitHub [Issues](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/issues) page. Do not include private data, credentials, or "
"security vulnerability details in the form or public issues; follow the "
"repository security policy. Including the following information will help us"
" assist you faster:"
msgstr ""
"軽量な不具合報告や機能追加リクエストは [フィードバックフォーム](https://forms.gle/c8jJaf9UCs5tb5cC8) "
"から送れます。 再現性があり public に追跡したい技術的な問題は、GitHub の "
"[Issues](https://github.com/tatsuki-washimi/gwexpy/issues) "
"にエラーログを添えて報告してください。 個人情報、認証情報、セキュリティ脆弱性の詳細はフォームや public issue に含めず、 "
"リポジトリのセキュリティポリシーに従ってください。 報告時には以下の情報を含めていただけるとスムーズです："

